{"id":5122,"chapter_id":5,"scene_id":515,"steps":[{"step":2,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"那个人还活着……局长，你做到了。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"休息一会儿吧，刚刚的战斗你过度使用权能，身体撑不住的。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"休息一下，我和你一起回收卓娅。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"……局长？局长你要去哪里？","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122005"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"你向卓娅走去。大脑像是灌了铅，脚下却如踩棉花般虚浮无力，每一步都快栽倒在地上。但你还是跌撞地走到她面前。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"卓娅失去意识，身上的尖刺没有消失，她垂着头站着，再无声息。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"options":["醒醒，卓娅"],"jump":[9],"style":6,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"content":"你牵引枷锁，在另一头只感到泥泞的污染。<color=#fb9259>那个东西</color>还在，正因为虚弱，才更加拼死求生，钻进卓娅灵魂更深处。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"options":["清醒过来！想想你真正该做的事！"],"jump":[11],"style":6,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"content":"你拿出036给你的所有异方三角，像他一样，双手按在卓娅太阳穴，撑着她的头，命令着，请求着。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"所有的三角快速消耗，蓝色水晶迅速暗淡、破碎，像沙砾般从你手中流走。你的意识也快速模糊起来。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"options":["不要被它带走，那不是你"],"jump":[14],"style":6,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"content":"她仍旧垂着头，一只手却突然抬起，紧紧地抓住了你。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"？？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>是我的……是我的……！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122015"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"！！梦魇！唔——！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122016"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"content":"赫卡蒂没有召唤梦魇的余力了。受卓娅影响，枷锁变得无比沉重，压迫着与你相连的所有人。她们都露出极度痛苦的表情。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"036","content":"<color=#fb9259>消灭卓娅</color>是已知有效，且唯一能有效阻止这场灾难的方法。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122018"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":506,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"content":"你口袋里有<color=#fb9259>枪</color>。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"speaker":"702","content":"阻止……黑环…………一定要阻止……","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122020"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":506,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"content":"这个距离，就算是你也不会失手。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"content":"像是感应到你的想法，周围的污染涌向你的双手。但同时几发蓝色的子弹从身后射来，击碎了污秽。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"speaker":"036","content":"${PlayerName}！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122022"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"speaker":"036","content":"${PlayerName}，动手。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122024"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":26,"speaker":"036","content":"只有你能做到！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122025"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":27,"content":"余光中你看到，海拉昏迷倒地，赫卡蒂失去了她的梦魇，036 斜倚在墙上，用最后的力气支援你，他的子弹已经打空，眼神近乎哀求。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":28,"content":"你不知道什么是黑环，但你已经明白，如果不能阻止它，它就会毁掉在场每一个人。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":29,"content":"扼住你的力量愈发强大，这是你跟那个存在的殊死搏斗。你的手终于动了起来，你的选择是——","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":30,"options":["枪","枷锁"],"jump":[31,47],"style":4,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":31,"content":"你拿出枪，抵住卓娅的额头，她微微抬眼，时间在这一刻静止。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":32,"content":"你看到最后一缕光芒消失，它变成了一只陌生的眼睛，狂热、恐惧、憎恨、贪婪——那个可憎的存在已经夺走她了。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":33,"content":"……至少不能让你摧毁她的心。","style":2,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":34,"options":["扣动扳机"],"jump":[35],"style":6,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":35,"content":"轰——","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":36,"content":"一阵猛烈的冲击袭来，她松了手，而你也被弹到一边，耳鸣目眩。这不是你射出的子弹，是威力更大的、更凶狠的——<color=#fb9259>微型炸弹</color>。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":37,"content":"你卧倒在地，冰冷的地面传来熟悉的金属脚步声，一个熟人走进大厅。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":38,"speaker":"厄尔希","content":"……别碰她。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122037"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":39,"speaker":"036","content":"你——","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122038"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":40,"speaker":"厄尔希","content":"滚！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122039"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":41,"content":"036想拦下对方，但那重伤的身体轻易就被撞开，推翻在地。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":42,"content":"厄尔希也受不少伤，但跟在场的其他人相比，他却是最有行动能力的那个。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":43,"speaker":"厄尔希","content":"军团长不会死在这里。不能死在你们手上。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122042"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":44,"speaker":"厄尔希","content":"……你不配。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122043"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":45,"content":"他用金属义腿一脚踢开你的手枪，头也不回地迈过你动弹不得的身体，向卓娅走去。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":47,"content":"你没有掏枪，只是把手覆上她的额头。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":48,"content":"以你的力量，本可以轻松掐断我的脖子。但我还活着。","style":2,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":49,"content":"你在这里吧，卓娅？回应我，跟我回去。","style":2,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":50,"speaker":"036","content":"快停下，你受不了的！不要——","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122049"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":51,"content":"你发动了枷锁。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":52,"speaker":"卓娅","content":"啊啊啊啊啊啊——！！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122051"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":53,"speaker":"卓娅？？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>放开她，放开她！！！她是我的！！</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122052"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":54,"content":"扼住你脖子的力量骤然增大，你的意识模糊了，听不到众人的呼喊，渐渐远离刺耳的嚣叫，只紧紧抓着一个念头不放——<color=#fb9259>不能放手</color>。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":55,"content":"砰——砰砰砰——","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":56,"content":"一串子弹打中了掐住你的手，你支撑不住向后倒去，手离开了卓娅的身体。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":57,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"局长！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122056"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":58,"content":"也许是生的希望给了她力量，残破的梦魇被唤起，趁污染重新凝聚成捕捉你的手臂前，裹着你向后退去，远离危险。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":59,"content":"你卧倒在地，冰冷的地面传来熟悉的金属脚步声，一个熟人走进大厅。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":60,"speaker":"厄尔希","content":"……比我想象的还要顽固。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122059"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":61,"speaker":"厄尔希","content":"你的枷锁已经输了，别再白白送命。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122060"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":62,"speaker":"厄尔希","content":"还没到你出手的时候……","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122061"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":63,"options":["你说……什么？"],"jump":[64],"style":6,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":64,"speaker":"厄尔希","content":"……团长她交给你了。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122063"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":65,"content":"这是他对你说的最后一句话。随即，男人迈过你，走向卓娅，走向那只眼睛。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":66,"content":"污染重新溢出，自下而上缠住他负伤的身体，却只换来军团参谋一声冷笑。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":67,"speaker":"厄尔希","content":"真是狼狈，被那个人伤成这样……现在的你就算把团长敲骨吸髓，也没办法再降生吧？","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122065"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":68,"speaker":"卓娅？？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>呃呃呃啊啊啊——！！给我、给我——！！</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122066"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":69,"content":"他一手摁住她身上血肉侵入留下的疤痕。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":70,"speaker":"厄尔希","content":"——别再碰她了。我帮你，拿我的骨血、灵魂和一切。来我这里！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122068"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":71,"speaker":"卓娅？？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>你不够资格，你不够，你——！！？？</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122069"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":72,"content":"在厄尔希的手上漏出了怪异的白光，那光芒竟有些眼熟。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":73,"speaker":"卓娅？？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>啊——这是，是她！是她！！哈哈哈哈哈，给我、给我吧——！</color></i>","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122071"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":74,"content":"它的力量猛然爆发，黑色的尖刺接触到厄尔希的身体，将他拖近卓娅。","style":3,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":75,"speaker":"036","content":"住手！！离开她，禁闭者不要靠近她，黑环会毁了这里的一切！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122073"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":76,"speaker":"厄尔希","content":"哈哈……那又如何？这里还不配用她的命交换。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122074"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":77,"speaker":"厄尔希","content":"来吧，狄斯城，清算的时间到了，迎接黑环吧……","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122075"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":78,"speaker":"厄尔希","content":"这是你给辛迪加种的恶果，是你应得的。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122076"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":502,"log_type":1},{"step":79,"content":"污秽咆哮着将二人吞噬融为一体，尖刺撞碎地面、掀破穹顶，紫色秽光爆发摧毁你眼前一切可视之物。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":80,"content":"而你的意识，在看到赤色光环的瞬间，被无数暗影攀附，拖拽着，坠入深渊。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":83,"speaker":"？？","content":"工作完成。该走了，在缠人的蜘蛛爬过来之前。","voice":["vo_cgplot_5122080"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":1,"background":511,"log_type":1},{"step":84,"voice":["vo_cgplot_5122080"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_05","style":18,"background":511,"log_type":1}]}